<Layout title="Website Terms | ZakTec Solutions" description="General terms for using the ZakTec Solutions website and its published information.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Legal" title="Website Terms" description="The basic terms for using this website." />

  <section class="section-space">
    <div class="section-shell">
      <div class="content-page">
        <p><strong class="text-white">Last reviewed:</strong> 23 July 2026</p>
        <p>These terms cover the public ZakTec Solutions website. Any project will have its own written scope, quote and terms.</p>

        <h2>Website information</h2>
        <p>This website gives general information about our services and projects. It is not legal, financial, security or other professional advice.</p>

        <h2>Project enquiries</h2>
        <p>Sending an enquiry does not start a project. Work begins only after both sides agree the scope, responsibilities, timescale, price and terms in writing.</p>

        <h2>AI-related information</h2>
        <p>AI output can be wrong or incomplete and must be checked. Do not enter sensitive information into an AI service unless its use has been approved.</p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Unless stated otherwise, ZakTec Solutions owns this website's original text, design and branding. Third-party names and tools belong to their owners.</p>

        <h2>External links</h2>
        <p>ZakTec Solutions does not control external websites and is not responsible for their content, availability or privacy practices.</p>

        <h2>Availability</h2>
        <p>The website may change or be temporarily unavailable. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access.</p>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>Nothing here excludes liability where that would be unlawful. Otherwise, you use the website and its general information at your own risk.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these website terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@zaktecsolutions.com">hello@zaktecsolutions.com</a>.</p>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/5 p-5 text-sm text-amber-100">
          These general website terms should receive a formal legal review before being relied upon for commercial engagements.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
